# The instagram collection is registered and deliberately empty.
#
# The owners choose which posts represent them. One JSON file per post,
# with the image saved under src/assets/instagram/:
#
#   { "image": "../../assets/instagram/2026-07-14.jpg",
#     "caption": { "sr": "...", "en": "..." },
#     "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/XXXXXXXXX/",
#     "postedAt": "2026-07-14" }
#
# The four most recent by postedAt render. There is no order field.
